# Ignore Visual Studio temporary files, build results, and
# files generated by popular Visual Studio add-ons.

**/obj
**/bin
**/Debug
**/Release
**/TestResults

# Ignore build results

**/out
**/dist

# Ignore dependencies

**/.next
**/node_modules

# Ignore Claude agent worktrees

.claude/worktrees/agent-*

# Ignore Playwright live-test session state and seed data

**/e2e/.auth

# Ignore environment files

**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.test

# Ignore operator-filled Kubernetes secret files (keep template secret.yaml tracked)

infra/k8s/**/*.secret.yaml
